    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 pb-16 lg:pb-24">
      <div class="prose prose-lg prose-blue max-w-none text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
        <p class="text-2xl font-medium text-gray-900 mb-8 italic">
          Most Christmas gift lists for men are a pile of novelty gadgets. This one is built around a simpler idea: give him a better version of something he already uses every week, and it will still be in use next Christmas.
        </p>

        <QuickPicks products={PRODUCTS} />

        <div id="short-answer" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">
            1. The Short Answer: What Are the Best Christmas Gifts for Men?
          </h2>

          <p>
            The best Christmas gifts for men are things he will use every week and would not quite justify buying for himself. That sounds obvious, but it rules out most of what gets wrapped in December: novelty gadgets, gift sets he will never open and anything that needs him to change his habits before it becomes useful. A good Christmas gift for a man upgrades something he already does. If he fixes things, give him a better tool. If he cooks, give him a pan that outlasts the one he has. If he drinks coffee every morning, make that coffee better.
          </p>

          <p>
            If you want one answer, buy the Leatherman Wave+. It is useful to nearly every man, it is built to last decades, and Leatherman backs it with a 25-year warranty. If you know more about him, use the sections below: the gifts are grouped by who he is, with a price band on each so you can see the options at your budget at a glance. Fourteen of the picks are products we already recommend in our own buyer's guides, and we link to those guides so you can read the full case.
          </p>

          <p>
            As for must-have Christmas gifts for men, the short list is a quality multi-tool, a cast iron skillet, a proper flashlight, a pair of gloves that actually keep his hands warm and a reliable cordless drill kit if he does not own one. None of them is exciting on the label. All of them get used for years, which is the only test of a gift that really matters.
          </p>

          <div class="bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-6 lg:p-8 my-8">
            <p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#38BDF8] mb-3">THE RULE</p>
            <p class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Upgrade what he already does.</p>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed m-0">The gifts men keep are almost always better versions of things they use weekly. The gifts that end up in a closet are almost always invitations to start a new hobby.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div id="how-we-picked" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">
            2. How We Chose These 22 Gifts
          </h2>

          <p>
            We started with our own work. The Honest Reviewers publishes buyer's guides on tools, appliances, cookware, outdoor gear and grooming, and many of those products happen to make excellent presents. Where a gift on this list is a pick from one of our guides, we say so on the card and link to the guide, and the verdict you read here is the verdict from that guide. You can read more about our approach on our <a href="/how-we-test/">how we test</a> page.
          </p>

          <p>
            The rest are classic gifts for men that sit outside our usual categories: a multi-tool, a flashlight, an e-reader, earbuds, a tumbler, a trimmer, a coffee maker and a thermometer. For those, we confirmed the exact current model from the maker or a major retailer and report the specifications as the maker lists them. We avoided anything discontinued, anything with an unclear model number and anything whose price varied so wildly between sellers that we could not give an honest price band.
          </p>

          <p>
            Prices are shown as bands rather than exact figures because Christmas pricing moves daily. The bands reflect list prices we checked in October 2026; many of these items go on sale in late November and December, so treat the band as a ceiling rather than a promise.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Picks -->
        <div id="top-picks" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">
            3. The 22 Best Christmas Gifts for Men, by Who He Is
          </h2>

          <p>
            Picks are grouped by the kind of man you are buying for: our overall pick first, then the DIYer and garage guy, the cook and griller, the coffee drinker, the outdoorsman and everyday carry, grooming, the home gym and tech. Each card shows a price band based on list prices we checked in October 2026. Where a pick comes from one of our buyer's guides, the card says which one.
          </p>

          {PRODUCTS.map((product, index) => (
