          </p>

          <p>
            At the other end, the splurges on this page are deliberately few. A $300 gift should be something he would want for a decade, which is why the expensive picks are a Dutch oven, a set of dumbbells and a professional torque wrench rather than gadgets that will be superseded by next Christmas.
          </p>
